      "writtenOn": "2024-10-03T23:32:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One potential fix would be to make the charge manager ignore a source only if available voltage is 0:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/charge_manager.c;l\u003d716-718\n```\n-    if (available_charge[i][j].voltage \u003d\u003d 0 || ...current \u003d\u003d 0)\n+    if (available_charge[i][j].voltage \u003d\u003d 0)\n        continue;\n```\nThis will make the charge manager select a source such as 5V 0mA. We need to ensure all boards set 0V 0mA when disabling the source (I assume that\u0027s the case).",
      "parentUuid": "23d5f865_964dd8c3",
      "revId": "fdbd5e867e12e4fe6d5964b7905c54d9bfe60c26",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
